{
  "info": {
    "name": "DemoQA BookStore API",
    "description": "Collection baseada no Swagger do DemoQA (https://demoqa.com/swagger/), organizada por endpoints (Account e BookStore).\n\nUse a variavel de collection `baseUrl`. Os scripts capturam automaticamente `userId`, `token` e os primeiros ISBNs, permitindo rodar o fluxo na ordem: Criar usuario -> Gerar token -> Authorized -> Listar livros -> Alugar -> Detalhes do usuario.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://demoqa.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userName", "value": "qauser_postman", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "Senha@123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "isbn1", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "isbn2", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Account",
      "description": "Endpoints de conta e autenticacao (/Account/v1).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Criar usuario",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Gera um userName unico a cada execucao para evitar 'User exists!' (code 1204).",
                  "const unico = 'qauser_' + Date.now();",
                  "pm.environment.set('userName', unico);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userName', unico);",
                  "console.log('userName gerado:', unico);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201 (Created)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.userID) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('userId', body.userID);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.userID);",
                  "  console.log('userId salvo:', body.userID);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('resposta tem userID e username', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('userID');",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('username');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userName\": \"{{userName}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Account/v1/User",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Account", "v1", "User"]
            },
            "description": "Cria um usuario. Senha deve ter maiuscula, minuscula, digito, caractere especial e min. 8 caracteres.\n\nRespostas conhecidas:\n- 201: usuario criado { userID, username, books }\n- 406 / code 1204: 'User exists!' (usuario ja existe)\n- 400 / code 1300: senha fora da politica\n- 400 / code 1200: 'UserName and Password required.' (campo vazio)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Gerar token de acesso",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.token) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', body.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "  console.log('token salvo');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"status = 'Success'\", () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('Success'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userName\": \"{{userName}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Account/v1/GenerateToken",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Account", "v1", "GenerateToken"]
            },
            "description": "Gera um token JWT para o usuario.\n\nResposta: { token, expires, status, result }.\n- Credenciais invalidas -> 200 com status 'Failed' e token null."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirmar autorizacao (Authorized)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "console.log('authorized =', pm.response.text());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userName\": \"{{userName}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Account/v1/Authorized",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Account", "v1", "Authorized"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna um booleano (true/false).\n\nObservacao: o usuario so fica 'true' DEPOIS de gerar o token. Antes disso retorna false.\n- Usuario inexistente -> 404 / code 1207 'User not found!'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalhes do usuario",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('tem userId, username e books', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('userId');",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('username');",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('books');",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('livros do usuario:', body.books ? body.books.length : 0);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Account/v1/User/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Account", "v1", "User", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Consulta os detalhes do usuario, incluindo os livros alugados. Requer token (Bearer)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalhes do usuario (sem token) - erro 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 401 sem token', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Account/v1/User/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Account", "v1", "User", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Cenario negativo: consultar detalhes sem Authorization retorna 401."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "BookStore",
      "description": "Endpoints da livraria (/BookStore/v1).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar livros disponiveis",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('lista nao vazia', () => pm.expect(body.books.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "if (body.books.length >= 2) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('isbn1', body.books[0].isbn);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('isbn2', body.books[1].isbn);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('isbn1', body.books[0].isbn);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('isbn2', body.books[1].isbn);",
                  "  console.log('isbn1:', body.books[0].isbn, '| isbn2:', body.books[1].isbn);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/BookStore/v1/Books",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["BookStore", "v1", "Books"]
            },
            "description": "Lista todos os livros. O script salva os dois primeiros ISBNs em isbn1/isbn2 para o aluguel."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Alugar livros",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201 (Created)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('retornou os livros alugados', () => pm.expect(body.books.length).to.be.above(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"collectionOfIsbns\": [\n    { \"isbn\": \"{{isbn1}}\" },\n    { \"isbn\": \"{{isbn2}}\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/BookStore/v1/Books",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["BookStore", "v1", "Books"]
            },
            "description": "Aluga os livros informados para o usuario. Requer token (Bearer).\n\nRespostas conhecidas:\n- 201: { books: [{ isbn }] }\n- 401: sem token\n- 400 / code 1205: 'ISBN supplied is not available in Books Collection!' (ISBN inexistente)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar livro por ISBN",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/BookStore/v1/Book?ISBN={{isbn1}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["BookStore", "v1", "Book"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "ISBN", "value": "{{isbn1}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Consulta os detalhes de um unico livro pelo ISBN (passado como query param)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Substituir livro alugado",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"isbn\": \"{{isbn2}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/BookStore/v1/Books/{{isbn1}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["BookStore", "v1", "Books", "{{isbn1}}"]
            },
            "description": "Substitui um livro alugado (isbn1) por outro (isbn2) na colecao do usuario. Requer token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remover livro alugado",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"isbn\": \"{{isbn1}}\",\n  \"userId\": \"{{userId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/BookStore/v1/Book",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["BookStore", "v1", "Book"]
            },
            "description": "Remove um livro especifico da colecao do usuario. Requer token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remover todos os livros alugados",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/BookStore/v1/Books?UserId={{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["BookStore", "v1", "Books"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "UserId", "value": "{{userId}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Remove todos os livros da colecao do usuario. Requer token."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Limpeza",
      "description": "Passo final opcional: exclui o usuario criado para nao deixar residuo.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Excluir usuario",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 204 (No Content)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/Account/v1/User/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["Account", "v1", "User", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Exclui o usuario criado no inicio do fluxo. Requer token (Bearer). Retorna 204 sem corpo.\n- Sem token -> 401 'User not authorized!'.\n\nDeve ser o ULTIMO passo, pois apos excluir o usuario o token perde a validade."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
